      "message": "**Issue #2 (🟡 Medium Severity (SHOULD FIX))**: Test case tag uses plural \"Managers\" — inconsistency with single-manager scope\n\n**Issue**: The test configures and deletes a single SNMP manager (`${SNMP_MGR1_IP}`). The plural tag name (`Managers`) implies multiple managers are deleted, which is misleading and inconsistent with the actual scope.\n-\n\n**Fix**:\n```robot\n      [Tags]  Delete_SNMP_Manager_Via_GUI_And_Generate_Error_On_BMC\n  ```\n\n**Why**: Tag names are used for targeted test execution and CI filtering; an inaccurate name causes confusion and reduces discoverability.",
